# Workspace baseline (plugins/CLAUDE.md authoring & hygiene conventions).
# Ignore git worktrees under .claude/ (one left there is a `git add .` away from
# vendoring a nested repo) and runtime cruft — but NOT the whole .claude/, so the
# repo can still ship dev-time skills/settings under .claude/.
.claude/worktrees/
# Same hazard for worktrees created at the repo root (vcr-worktree-onramp convention,
# `.worktrees/<name>`) — untracked, and a nested checkout scripts/test.sh must skip via
# git check-ignore, not vendor via a blanket `git add -A`.
.worktrees/
.claude/*.local.md
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
tmp.*
*.tmp
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
node_modules/
.venv/
dist/
